    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Auxĭmum</span></b> , i,
		n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				town of the Piceni</i>, now <i>Osimo</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				1, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vell. 1, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 3868</span></i>;
			<i><span class="en">3899</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Auxĭ-mātes</span></b> , ium,
				m., <i>the inhabitants of Auximum</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Caes.
				B. C. 1, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 9, § 63</span></i>; cf.
			Mann. Ital. I. p. 489 sq.</div>
